# Gloo, Swamp Spirits

> Gloo is a lockdown tank that wins fights by turning an enemy carry into a piece of his own equipment. Two nerf rounds across patches 2.1.61 and 2.1.88 cut his passive damage reduction, his S1 goo chip, and his attach regen, but the goo-reset loop keeps him a contested roam or exp lane pick when the draft is right. When it isn't, he is one of the easiest tanks to kite into irrelevance.

