## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-02. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Burn Attach (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Cursed Helmet, Glowing Wand, Oracle, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Cursed Helmet, Glowing Wand, Oracle
- Emblem: Basic Common Emblem with Agility, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when crowd control is light and the first two waves are decided by basic physical trades.; Athena's Shield over Antique Cuirass when Use when one burst mage can remove Gloo before the attach target is punished.; Radiant Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use against repeated magic ticks or poke that keeps landing during Lord dances.; Brute Force Breastplate over Antique Cuirass when Use when movement speed, cooldown reduction, and control-duration reduction matter more than physical skill mitigation.
- Total cost: 10810 gold

Default EXP setup that turns Gloo's S1 reset loop and attach window into sustained magic pressure without giving up the defenses needed to stay mounted.

### Roam Conceal Pickoff (Roam)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Cursed Helmet, Glowing Wand, Oracle, Guardian Helmet, Immortality
- Core: Cursed Helmet, Glowing Wand, Oracle
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Tough Boots over Rapid Boots when Use when crowd control chains are stopping Gloo before he can stack Sticky and attach.; Encourage over Conceal when Use as the roam blessing when your team groups front-to-back and does not need hidden pickoff angles.; Antique Cuirass over Guardian Helmet when Use when physical skill damage is killing Gloo during the first contact rather than after the fight resets.; Radiant Armor over Guardian Helmet when Use against sustained magic damage that follows Gloo through the attach and detach cycle.
- Total cost: 11190 gold

Roam setup for pickoff drafts where Conceal and Flicker create the angle, then repeated magic damage marks the host for allied follow-up.

### EXP Anti-Physical Wall (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Cursed Helmet, Glowing Wand, Chastise Pauldron, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Cursed Helmet, Glowing Wand, Chastise Pauldron
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when the physical threats are backed by enough stuns or slows to stop the attach setup.; Dominance Ice over Glowing Wand when Use when Gloo is mostly soaking basic attacks before attaching and the enemy sustain comes from heroes still hitting him. The two Lifebanes do not stack, so take the reactive one.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use against crit or basic-attack marksmen who cannot avoid hitting Gloo during Vengeance.; Athena's Shield over Antique Cuirass when Use when a burst mage, not physical skill damage, is the reason Gloo dies before the host falls.
- Total cost: 11070 gold

Physical-heavy EXP variant for games where Gloo must be the first body hit and Vengeance buys enough time for the attached target to collapse.

